### Health Check
GET https://chatbot-clinica-dental-production.up.railway.app/health

### Frontend
GET https://chatbot-clinica-dental-production.up.railway.app/

### Chat - Mensaje simple
POST https://chatbot-clinica-dental-production.up.railway.app/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hola, ¿qué servicios ofrecen?",
  "history": []
}

### Chat - Consultar disponibilidad
POST https://chatbot-clinica-dental-production.up.railway.app/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "¿Qué horarios tienen mañana?",
  "history": []
}

### Chat - Mensaje muy largo (debe fallar)
POST https://chatbot-clinica-dental-production.up.railway.app/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "",
  "history": []
}

### Consultar citas por teléfono
GET https://chatbot-clinica-dental-production.up.railway.app/api/citas?telefono=3001234567

### Cancelar cita (reemplazar :id con un ID real)
DELETE https://chatbot-clinica-dental-production.up.railway.app/api/citas/1
